<title>USA: Family Dollar names Levine president, COO.</title>
<headline>Family Dollar names Levine president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>MATTHEWS, N.C. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Family Dollar Stores Inc said Monday it had named Howard Levine as president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>Levine, who was senior vice president-merchandising and advertising, will also become a member of the board of directors, it said.</p>
<p>The company said Levine will succeed John Reier, who resigned to pursue other endeavors.</p>
<p>Family Dollar Stores operates 2,674 stores in 38 states.</p>
</text>
